{"seq":2,"slug":"kubernetes-orchestration","title":"容器编排与 Kubernetes","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":5,"docCount":18,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.13,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introMarkdown":"# 容器编排与 Kubernetes 简介\n\n容器技术彻底改变了应用程序的打包与分发方式，而 Kubernetes 作为容器编排的事实标准，为大规模容器化应用提供了自动化部署、伸缩与管理的完整解决方案。掌握 Kubernetes 是每位云原生工程师的必备技能。\n\n本手册面向有一定容器使用经验的开发者和运维工程师，系统讲解从容器基础到 Kubernetes 高级特性的完整知识体系。读者将学会如何设计、部署和运维生产级别的容器化应用。\n\n全书共分为四章，由基础到进阶逐步展开：\n\n第一章**容器基础**从容器的核心概念与运行时机制讲起，涵盖 Docker 的实践操作与镜像管理，并深入探讨容器安全与资源隔离的关键技术。\n\n第二章**Kubernetes 架构**剖析 Kubernetes 的整体架构设计，包括控制平面的核心组件协作机制、节点运行时与 kubelet 的工作原理，以及 etcd 在集群状态管理中的关键角色。\n\n第三章**工作负载管理**聚焦 Kubernetes 的核心工作负载类型，从 Pod 与 Deployment 的基础管理，到 StatefulSet 支撑有状态应用，再到 Job 与 CronJob 的任务调度策略。\n\n第四章**服务网络**讲解 Kubernetes 的网络模型与服务发现机制，包括 Service 的负载分发、Ingress 与 API 网关的流量接入，以及网络策略实现的安全通信。\n\n建议读者先掌握容器基础知识，再循序渐进地学习 Kubernetes 的架构和操作实践，辅以本地集群环境的动手实验加深理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-fundamentals","title":"容器基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/container-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-concepts","title":"容器核心概念","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/container-fundamentals/container-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"docker-practice","title":"Docker 实践","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/container-fundamentals/docker-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"container-security","title":"容器安全","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/container-fundamentals/container-security"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"k8s-architecture","title":"Kubernetes 架构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"control-plane","title":"Kubernetes 控制平面","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-architecture/control-plane"},{"seq":2,"slug":"node-runtime","title":"Kubernetes 节点与运行时","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-architecture/node-runtime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"etcd-state","title":"etcd 与集群状态管理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-architecture/etcd-state"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"k8s-workloads","title":"工作负载管理","docCount":6,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deployments","title":"Deployment 与 ReplicaSet","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/deployments"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stateful-apps","title":"有状态应用管理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/stateful-apps"},{"seq":3,"slug":"jobs-cronjobs","title":"Job 与 CronJob","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/jobs-cronjobs"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pods-deployments","title":"Pod 与 Deployment 实战","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/pods-deployments"},{"seq":5,"slug":"statefulsets","title":"StatefulSet 与有状态应用","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/statefulsets"},{"seq":6,"slug":"services-networking","title":"Service 与网络策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-workloads/services-networking"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"k8s-networking","title":"服务网络","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-discovery","title":"Service 发现与 DNS","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-networking/service-discovery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ingress-gateway","title":"Ingress 与 Gateway API","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-networking/ingress-gateway"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-policies","title":"网络策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-orchestration/k8s-networki